    <x:String x:Key="Diag_ResolveAdbMac">Voer in Terminal 'brew install android-platform-tools' uit.</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Diag_ResolveAdbLinux">Voer in de terminal 'sudo apt-get install adb' uit.</x:String>
